	abstract = {Methods: We quantiﬁed the strength of the relationships between temperature and precipitation and 21 plant traits from 447,961 species-site combinations worldwide. We used meta-analysis to provide an overall answer to our question.
Results: Mean annual temperature was signiﬁcantly more strongly correlated with plant traits than was mean annual precipitation.
